	('0d705da8-d85b-4211-91a0-53366fb1104b', '1b5b6a58-4842-4bc1-b972-da6b4d5ec761', 'lora', '{"Name": "Recursive Magic", "Author": "kabachuha", "Images": [{"url": "https://wczysqzxlwdndgxitrvc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/image_uploads/files/1753492287047-4hsa81jq.mp4", "type": "video", "alt_text": "1 (2).mp4"}, {"url": "https://wczysqzxlwdndgxitrvc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/image_uploads/files/1753492288384-qt5m9zdp.png", "type": "image", "alt_text": "videoframe_2494.png"}, {"url": "https://wczysqzxlwdndgxitrvc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/image_uploads/files/1753492289008-35tg43uu.mp4", "type": "video", "alt_text": "3 (2).mp4"}], "Model ID": "fractal-t2v.safetensors", "filename": "fractal-t2v.safetensors", "is_public": true, "lora_type": "Wan 2.1 14b", "base_model": "Wan 2.1 T2V", "created_by": {"is_you": false, "username": "kabachuha"}, "Description": "This t2v LoRA was trained on various fractal zooms, self-similarity and Droste effects and aims to help you replicate those dizzying experiences with custom items or persons.\n\nBecause it''s a t2v model, it works plug-and-play with LoRAs and VACE. The videos present are both with vanilla text2video and with VACE reference insertion. (4/1)\n\nAll the videos here were created without loop forcing in the workflow - in form of flf2v or otherwise! (emergent ability?)\n\nThis LoRA is quite experimental, and the dataset may be too diverse to focus fully. The anatomy can get really weird here, and it''s maybe a feature. (Check out the fractal hands!) It also has a slight cool colors and 3D model look bias.\n\nThere may be a version two in the future, though I think it''s already looking dope enough.\n\nThe trigger word is \"fractal help\".\n\nSome example prompts:\n\nfractal help. This animation shows an anime girl sitting still on a chair and holding a smartphone with an image of the anime girl herself sitting on a chair and holding a smartphone. The camera zooms in, showing the anime girl inside the smartphone holding another smartphone with the with an image of the anime girl herself sitting on a chair and holding a smartphone. The camera continues to zoom in, forming a perfect loop.\nfractal help. This animation shows a wooden table standing on a gigantic wooden table. The table is holding a miniature version of itself. The camera zooms in showing this miniature table version holding even smaller miniature table version of itself. The camera zooms in further, completing a perfect loop. The background is a home interior.\nLeave a comment if you''d like to provide feedback or ask for usage tips.", "Model Files": [{"url": "https://huggingface.co/peteromallet/ad_motion_loras/resolve/main/fractal-t2v.safetensors", "path": "fractal-t2v.safetensors"}], "trigger_word": "fractal help", "Last Modified": "2025-07-26T01:11:29.375Z", "huggingface_url": "https://huggingface.co/peteromallet/ad_motion_loras/resolve/main/fractal-t2v.safetensors", "main_generation": "https://wczysqzxlwdndgxitrvc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/image_uploads/files/1753492287047-4hsa81jq.mp4", "sample_generations": [{"url": "https://wczysqzxlwdndgxitrvc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/image_uploads/files/1753492287047-4hsa81jq.mp4", "type": "video", "alt_text": "1 (2).mp4"}, {"url": "https://wczysqzxlwdndgxitrvc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/image_uploads/files/1753492288384-qt5m9zdp.png", "type": "image", "alt_text": "videoframe_2494.png"}, {"url": "https://wczysqzxlwdndgxitrvc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/image_uploads/files/1753492289008-35tg43uu.mp4", "type": "video", "alt_text": "3 (2).mp4"}]}', '2025-07-31 15:04:26.211185+00'),
